title: SSHD Configuration Weakened
id: 8b073495-cd9b-45cf-af88-8ddd98a581ff
status: experimental
description: Detects modification of sshd_config to weaken authentication (PermitRootLogin yes, PasswordAuthentication yes, PermitEmptyPasswords yes), which an attacker uses to preserve or broaden remote access.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1556/
logsource:
  product: linux
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains: 'sshd_config'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'PermitRootLogin yes'
      - 'PermitEmptyPasswords yes'
      - 'PasswordAuthentication yes'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Administrators adjusting SSH policy
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1556
